---
Title: Obsidian links
Obsidian links: true
---

A link to [[Welcome]], one with an alias [[Welcome|the welcome note]], one to a heading [[Welcome#The guide]], one to a block [[Welcome#^intro]], and one within the note [[#Below]].

A path [[guide/Getting started.md]] and specials [[R&D_notes 50%]].

An image: ![[frame.png]]

At a width ![[frame.png|300]], a size ![[frame.png|300x200]], and alt text ![[frame.png|A frame|120]].

A note embed ![[Welcome]] prints as its text.

Code is left alone: `[[Welcome]]` and `![[frame.png]]`, and so is maths $[[a]] + b$. An escaped \[[Welcome]] stays.

```
[[Welcome]] ![[frame.png]]
```
